## 0.5. UTF-8 FILE I/O — HARD RULES (zh-CN Windows)

Full documentation: see `toolchain.md`. Summary hard rules below — these are
non-negotiable and override §0's "expand scope" prohibition for the specific
case of detecting / repairing mojibake (that work is IN-SCOPE whenever a file
under `src/data/{product,post,glossary}` or `src/pages/` is touched).

### 0.5.1 File write paths — NEVER use PowerShell redirection

Writing files through PowerShell on zh-CN Windows silently corrupts UTF-8 to
GBK. Accepted write paths:

- **Cline `editor` tool** (preferred for all `.astro`, `.ts`, `.md`, `.json`,
  `.yaml`, `.css` edits).
- **Node.js** `fs.writeFileSync(path, data, 'utf8')` for any script that
  generates content.

Forbidden (silently downgrades UTF-8 to GBK on zh-CN Windows):
- PowerShell `>` / `>>` / `Out-File` / `Set-Content` / `Add-Content` without
  `-Encoding utf8`.
- `cmd /c "... > file"` when invoked from the Cline shell.
- Any `tee` variant without explicit UTF-8.

If you discover you've just written a file via PowerShell redirection, the
file is corrupted. Do not commit it; rewrite it via the Cline `editor` tool.

### 0.5.2 Post-write verification — MANDATORY

After any file edit that contains non-ASCII characters, run:

```
node scripts/check-unicode.mjs
```

It MUST print `✓ Unicode check passed`. If it prints `✗ Unicode check FAILED`,
stop all subsequent file writes and fix the corruption first — do not stack
more files on top of a broken one.

### 0.5.3 Missing-data policy — NO silent guesses

If `fix-unicode.mjs` reveals a position where a digit was eaten by the
corruption (e.g., `4— weeks` where the original was `4–6 weeks`), do NOT
invent the missing digit. Mark the position with `[MISSING SPEC: <what's
missing>]` and surface it in the Completion Checklist under "Requires Human
Confirmation". Production content must never be silently fabricated.

### 0.5.4 White-listed Chinese-content paths

These paths legitimately contain CJK characters and are excluded from
`scripts/check-unicode.mjs`:

| Path | Reason |
|---|---|
| `src/prompts/**` | Chinese prompt templates |
| `src/data/query-acquisition/**` | KPI / source-type docs |
| `src/data/_templates/query-acquisition/**` | Schema / taxonomy templates |
| `src/data/monitor/**` | Chinese monitoring docs |
| `src/data/topics.ts` | Chinese topic vocabulary |
| `src/lib/schema.ts` | Chinese comments |
| `CUSTOM.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `docs/**` | Project documentation |
| `scripts/check-unicode.mjs`, `scripts/fix-unicode.mjs` | Intentional CJK regex codepoints |

Do not run `fix-unicode.mjs` against these paths; it would corrupt legitimate
Chinese content.
